==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{context|uncountable|lang=en}} [[repossession]]
# {{context|countable|finance|lang=en}} A [[repurchase]] agreement: a type of [[derivative]] which allows a borrower to use a financial [[security]] as [[collateral]] for a cash loan at a fixed interest rate
# {{context|countable|computing|informal|lang=en}} A [[source code]] [[repository]].

====Derived terms====
* [[repo man]]

====See also====
